SUMMARY:UMAP 2027 · Conference
DESCRIPTION:ACM International Conference on User Modeling\, Adaptation and 
 Personalization\nStatus: confirmed\, checked 2026-10-31\nOfficial source:
  https://um.org/umap2027/\nVenue Radar: https://gon-uri.github.io/venue-r
 adar/#umap-2027\nNotes: Official UMAP 2027 pages confirm the 35th edition
 \, fully in person at Conviser Law Center\, Chicago\, June 9-12\, 2027 (w
 orkshops and tutorials June 9\; Doctoral Consortium for selected students
  June 8). All dates are 11:59 pm AoE. The January 22 abstract with the fi
 nal author list is mandatory for long and short papers. Long\, short\, in
 dustry\, LBR and demo papers appear in the ACM DL (open access\; long and
  short papers may owe an APC)\; workshop papers go to CEUR-WS via per-wor
 kshop calls not yet published. On 2026-10-31 EasyChair said new submissio
 ns were open\, but several tracks share it\, so no opening is recorded. U
 MAP 2026 accepted 57 of 195 main-track papers. Size is an editorial estim
 ate.
CATEGORIES:Recommender Systems,Human-AI Interaction & Deployment,Fairness &
  Responsible AI
